Description: Spoofs iOS version, app version, and optional device/location/network/Wi-Fi signals per selected app. Fast wipe without ldid; backup/restore still need ldid. Shopee: IDFV+IDFA, DeviceCheck off, spoof iOS via UIDevice/sysctl, no WK/gestalt. Profile restore chown mobile + kill cfprefsd. Change path is 1.2.14.
